---
description: >-
  Markdown emphasis in every ER label kind, as v12 formats it (#754, D565):
  entity name, alias, attribute type, name and comment, relationship label and
  subgraph title; an underscore inside a word stays
---
erDiagram
  "This **is** _Markdown_" {
    string name
  }
  P["*Alias*"] {
    **bold** _it_ PK "a __comment__"
    int order_item
  }
  subgraph Sales ["Sales **domain**"]
    order_item
  end
  P ||--o{ order_item : "__rel__"
